window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I have come back to Arcadia, but all is not as it should be.</p> <p>An impostor sits on Windhelm's throne, and calling herself Queen. I don't know where my parents are or what's become of them. I don't know where my brother is, or if he's even still alive. And in less than two weeks, Fate itself will hunt me down and end my existence as if I wasn't meant to exist in the first place.</p> <p>This is it.</p> <p>If I don't figure out how to fix the mistake I made, Arcadia itself could fall and become something entirely monstrous. I just wish I knew where to start.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
